#, no-wrap
msgid "[Executor quickstart](/guides/get-started-with-executor)\n"
msgstr "[Szybki start z Executor](/guides/get-started-with-executor)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Noise learning helper](/guides/noise-learning)\n"
msgstr "[Pomocnik uczenia szumu](/guides/noise-learning)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Both of these new features are currently in beta and require `qiskit-ibm-runtime` version 0.47.0 or higher.\n"
msgstr "  Obie te nowe funkcje są obecnie w wersji beta i wymagają wersji `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.47.0 lub nowszej.\n"

